+# Execution Plan: Guided first-session eligibility
+
+## Goal
+
+Show the guided first-session walkthrough only after a qualifying new-user long-quiz entry, while failing closed for established, upgraded, migrated, or ambiguous local state.
+
+## Acceptance Criteria
+
+| ID | Criterion | Status | Notes |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| AC-1 | A completed qualifying long quiz records durable admission before the signup handoff. | complete | The focused pack and both fresh-account journeys passed twice at exact product head `b20d12fb`. |
+| AC-2 | Existing long-quiz state without the marker is ineligible. | complete | Both established-account journeys stayed on ordinary Home at exact product head `b20d12fb`. |
+| AC-3 | Consumption, incomplete quiz state, missing exposure, and retry limits continue to fail closed. | complete | The 146/146 focused pack at `b20d12fb` pins consumed-state precedence and the complete eligibility matrix. |
+| AC-4 | Cache erasure clears admission; explicit internal QA and UI-test routes remain usable. | complete | Live logout now includes the personalization service, and warm-start token account switching routes through canonical logout instead of bypassing cache cleanup. |
+| AC-5 | Focused unit, native regression, and repeated-launch proof pass at the exact PR head. | complete | Exact-head proof at `b20d12fb` passed the root selector 1/1, focused units 146/146, established-user journeys 2/2, and fresh-account journeys 2/2. |
+
+## Implementation Approach
+
+- Persist a dedicated boolean admission marker alongside guided-session consumption state.
+- Set it only when the long quiz completes through the current onboarding flow.
+- Require it before resolving a production hero; allow only explicit internal-QA/UI-test assignments to bypass it.
+- Preserve it in the existing internal-QA backup and clear it during account cache erasure.
+
+## Constraints
+
+- Preserve lifecycle owner `019fb6d0-a2db-7291-aabe-dd10a3db9623` and require exact-head evidence for every native and TestFlight claim.
+- The owner-bound Beast campaign is terminally released; do not replay its offer, worker, or simulator lease.
+- Preserve Manual TestFlight run 1853 as exact evidence for `b20d12fb`; this plan-only reconciliation creates a distinct source head and therefore requires one fresh, deduplicated binding after run 1853 finishes.
